    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1"
    },
    {
      "line": "En siete días Dios creó al mundo. (Sol,,30)(Mi,m,220)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "Adán pecó y perdió el cielo. (Sol,,10)(Mi,m,145)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "Jesús vino para redimirnos, (Sol,,20)(Mi,m,165)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "Murió en la cruz y nos salvó. (Do,,20)(Re,,190)",
      "sC": ""
    },
    {
      "line": "",
      "sC": "adb1"
    },

